  "help": [
    {
      "art": "lanes",
      "body": "Drag anywhere: a short drag moves the pack a lane, and each lane-width more moves one more. A tap moves one lane toward that side. Keys: arrows, A/D or H/L. Some obstacles move: an arrow shows where.",
      "title": "Switch lanes"
    },
    {
      "art": "pickups",
      "body": "Tips are {tip} each, and they're most of your earnings, so grab plenty. A dog that reaches a treat cheers its owner: +{treatHearts}♥. Aim for a lost wallet or a generous neighbor, too.",
      "title": "Tips and treats"
    },
    {
      "art": "cards",
      "body": "A skunk, a thief or another dog opens a card. Each option costs cash, hearts or a debuff, and one always costs no cash. A puddle makes the pack Muddy. Debuffs wear off after {debuffSeconds}s. Hold a card, an icon or a bar for details.",
      "title": "Some bumps bring cards"
    },
    {
      "art": "owners",
      "body": "Each owner has hearts: {smallHearts}♥ small, {mediumHearts}♥ medium, {bigHearts}♥ big, but big dogs slow your lane changes. A plain bump costs {bumpHearts}♥ from the owner of the dog that touched it. Small dogs dodge 1 in {dodgeIn} plain bumps. At 0♥ the owner fires you.",
      "title": "Keep owners happy"
    },
    {
      "art": "pulls",
      "body": "Every dog loves squirrels. Touching one does nothing, but a bubble and a line to it mean a dog is straining. Steer away and the pull is off; wait and the pack lurches one lane toward it. A pull never drags you into a bump too close to dodge.",
      "title": "Watch for pulls"
    },
    {
      "art": "zones",
      "body": "Walk {walkLength} neighborhoods of {world}, each busier than the last. Each dog's pay is banked as you finish one. At a fork, each path brings an upgrade, and harder ones pay more. Bring every dog home for the Full pack bonus.",
      "title": "Neighborhoods"
    }
  ],
